{"translator":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）","rows":[{"id":"user-1","name":"プロデューサー","text":"──やったな！　樹里！","trans":"——太棒了！　树里！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"6011003050010","name":"樹里","text":"ああ……！\r\nけど、まだ次があるだろ……！","trans":"嗯……！\n不过，还有下一场吧……！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-3","name":"プロデューサー","text":"そうだけど、でも\r\n樹里が頑張ったことは変わらないだろ","trans":"话是这么说，可是\n树里努力过这件事不会变吧","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-4","name":"プロデューサー","text":"すごく良いステージだった！","trans":"是非常棒的舞台！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"6011003050020","name":"樹里","text":"……そ、そーかよ！","trans":"……是、是吗！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"6011003050040","name":"樹里","text":"──優勝してさ","trans":"——我要夺冠","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"6011003050050","name":"樹里","text":"それで、応援してくれた人たちみんなに\r\nお礼、言わなきゃだからな","trans":"然后，得向所有为我应援的人\n好好道谢才行","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"6011003050060","name":"樹里","text":"……もちろん、アンタにも","trans":"……当然，也包括你","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true}],"additionalSources":[{"id":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","package":"enza-player-app-fix.zip","dictionary":"data/translations/zh_dynamic.json","sha256":"63c8feb976e689fa7d5b8d21e48ce143c9f462fdaa8a2d1c3367e9c7fccefd98","credit":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）"}]}